{"title":"Expansions","description":"\u003cp\u003eExpansions for our Fraction VST\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"monuments","title":"Monuments","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMonuments Expansion\u003c\/strong\u003e with 60 New Presets and 30 Sound Sources for Fraction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for moments in your music that need weight and presence. Deep evolving layers, powerful harmonies, and wide tonal movement that feels massive without being noisy or interrupting. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTags: Cinematic, Brutal, Heroic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52770245542155,"sku":null,"price":19.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/MM_88afedae-69cd-4a49-bcc2-5d90bd9a83a3.png?v=1765997337"},{"product_id":"core-synth","title":"Core-Synth","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCore-Synth Expansion\u003c\/strong\u003e (free) with 65 New Presets and 30 Sound Sources for Fraction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA collection of clean and modern synth sounds with a focus of keys and plucks that just always work. These sounds sit immediately in the mix and are reliable go-to sounds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTags: Reliable, Modern, Foundational\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52797811589387,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/artwork.png?v=1767114965"},{"product_id":"lifeforms","title":"Lifeforms","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifeforms Expansion\u003c\/strong\u003e with 100 New Presets and 30 Sound Sources for Fraction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExplore the living, breathing sound of textures, unstable tones and imperfect details. Every sound feels alive and unpredictable - made with Viom's experimental Guitar Pedal Chain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTags: Experimental, Living, Imperfect\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52827408630027,"sku":null,"price":29.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/LF_b2f1fee6-d661-4f3d-a93c-09affefbfea7.png?v=1771619249"},{"product_id":"chrome","title":"Chrome","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChrome Expansion\u003c\/strong\u003e with 60 New Presets and 35 Sound Sources for Fraction.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA reflective collection built around metallic resonances, glass textures, and sharp synthetic movement. Explore sounds that are precise, sharp and unexpected with Chrome.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTags: Metallic, Liquid, Sharp\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52928144834827,"sku":null,"price":19.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/CH.png?v=1771983581"},{"product_id":"tape-dreams","title":"Tape Dreams","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTape Dreams Expansion\u003c\/strong\u003e (free) with 80 New Presets and 40 Sound Sources for Fraction.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA tape collection of nostalgic sound design paired with warped synths and noises. Built around textures full of character and presets that showcase the New Fraction Noise Modes. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTags: Nostalgic, Dusty, Textured\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":53183117885707,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/artwork_6ef4b575-68c7-4fc8-a39d-952e48e28695.png?v=1781603452"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/collections\/HL_870a33d2-5e49-4a4f-ae2d-fb2eecdde223.png?v=1768657562","url":"https:\/\/eraformaudio.com\/collections\/expansion.oembed","provider":"Eraform Audio","version":"1.0","type":"link"}